        "created_at": "2013-12-10T21:05:06.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Zero Tolerance was a better game, but yeah, Doom made the genre. &nbsp;Doom is to FPS what D&amp;D is to RPG.</p><p>I'd still love to see a FPS with different character classes like Zero Tolerance had, or even a FPS game where you could learn weapons.</p><p>I was 15 when Zero Tolerance came out and I had just gotten my Genesis, loved that game, and even converted one of my friends who was a die-hard Doom fan.</p>",
